	(descr "JNJ-L-2835CW-85020D-S-Q2 (LCSC C22447924), 850 nm 125 deg IR emitter, flat-top PLCC 3.5 x 2.8 x ~0.93 mm. Land pattern from the vendor recommended pad drawing, datasheet p.3: cathode 1.0 x 2.0, 0.8 gap, anode 1.8 x 2.0, 3.6 overall, centred on the body. Pad 1 = cathode (small, left, top view), pad 2 = anode (large, right, the thermal pad), as JLCPCB's own library part for C22447924 also has it. The pads are unequal, so the part cannot seat mirrored. Three thermal vias in the anode pad, NOT in the vendor drawing; the fourth corner (x 1.25, y -0.4) is left empty because the +5V back-side route crosses it under D2.")
